<title>CANADA: Gendis sets normal course issuer bid.</title>
<headline>Gendis sets normal course issuer bid.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gendis Inc said on Tuesday it set a normal course issuer bid for a maximum of 846,812 class A shares with purchases starting on January 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Gendis said that in the month ended August 31 it bought 10,000 of its class A shares for C$80,750. Total purchases since the normal course issuer bid commenced up to August 31 are 213,100 class A shares for a total consideration of C$2,244,980.</p>
<p>Gendis said the shares purchased represented 1.2582 percent of its issued and outstanding class A shares.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
